title: Recursive Hierarchical Network System (RHNS)
abstract: Neuro-symbolic cognitive architecture for recursive, governed multi-agent reasoning. Combines recursive goal trees, federated knowledge graphs, skill synthesis, metacognitive control, and symbolic constraint enforcement. Prior art established April 27, 2026 by Garrett Carrol, Garcar Enterprise.
